id: GO-SEC-020
title: Goroutine without context cancellation
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .go
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ _test.go
patterns:
  - regex: go\s+func\(\)\s*\{
    message: "Anonymous goroutine without context — risk of goroutine leak if parent exits"
  - regex: go\s+\w+\([^c]*\)$
    message: "Goroutine launched without context parameter — cannot be cancelled"
fix: Pass context.Context to goroutines and select on ctx.Done() for cleanup
